kpictureframe (2.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed blurry/pixelated pictures on HiDPI displays: sourceSize is now
    scaled by the screen's device pixel ratio (idea from @gaetan1903's
    PR #1, applied without its AnimatedImage -> Image regression).

