kpictureframe (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added randomize order option for slideshow mode.
  * Added pause-on-hover: slideshow pauses while the cursor is over the picture.
  * Fixed a wrong fuzzy-merged German translation for "Slideshow order:".

